<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰσίλ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Pers.</u>
			589
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			12.115
		</span></i>; 
			Ion.
		 and 
			Aeol.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰσιλ-ήϊος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰσιλ-ῇος</span></b>  Melinnoap.<i><span class="en">
			Stob.
			3.7.12
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Hymn.Is.</u>
			138
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>royal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεινὸν δὲ γένος βασιλήϊόν ἐστι
					κτείνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.401
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ β. θρόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.14
				</span></i>
			, etc.; used by Trag. in lyr., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β.
				οἶκοι, μέλαθρα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				157
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				343
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχύς, τιάρα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				589
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				661
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόστος ὁ β.</span>
			<i>the king's</i> return, ib.<i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς β. νόμοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					382
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῆχυς.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>of the archon</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλεύς, ἡ β. στοά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.115
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				7.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.3.1
			</span></i> (also of the <i>basilica</i> of Herod at Jerusalem, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				15.11.5
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> 'royal',
				i.e.<i>choice,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					23.19
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Crates Com.
				2
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασίλεια: γένος ἰσχάδων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἄρτεμις βασιληΐη,</span> divinity in
			Thrace, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.33
			</span></i>.</div>
